*   [dev.to](https://dev.to/kaeltiwari/open-source-vs-proprietary-llms-the-real-cost-breakdown-15d0). Kaeltiwari. (2026). Open Source vs Proprietary LLMs: The Real Cost Breakdown. DEV Community.
*   [effloow.com](https://effloow.com/articles/self-hosting-llms-vs-cloud-apis-cost-performance-privacy-2026). Effloow. (2026, April). Self-Hosting LLMs vs Cloud APIs: Cost, Speed, Privacy 2026.
